ment, oidc dynamic client registration, dpop, or acme account key registration, among others) to consume excessive cpu time, resulting in a denial of service."},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform 2","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat ansible automation platform 2"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat enterprise linux 10"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux 7","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat enterprise linux 7"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat enterprise linux 8"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat enterprise linux 9"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat OpenShift AI (RHOAI)","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat openshift ai (rhoai)"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat OpenStack Platform 16.2","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat openstack platform 16.2"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"product","object":"Red Hat OpenStack Platform 17.1","source":"cve","object_type":"string","object_canonical":"red hat openstack platform 17.1"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"rdf:type","object":"Vulnerability","source":"cve","object_type":"enum","object_canonical":"vulnerability"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"related-weakness","object":"CWE-407","source":"cve","object_type":"id","object_canonical":"CWE-407"},{"subject":"CVE-2026-92091","predicate":"state","object":"PUBLISHED","source":"cve","object_type":"en